# shelly

--- ShotgunGirl_Focus | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_SHELLY_FOCUS_DESC
raw  Shelly focuses her fire to a smaller area with an increased range. Can be used <!card.accessory.skill.maxAmmo> times per activation.
now  Shelly focuses her fire to a smaller area with an increased range. Can be used 3 times per activation.
  card.accessory.skill.maxAmmo  3  -> 3

--- ShotgunGirl_Focus | gadget | TID_SHOTGUNGIRL_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Shelly focuses her fire to a smaller area with an increased range. Can be used <!card.accessory.skill.maxAmmo> times per activation.\nAttacks slow enemies, slow duration increases with each hit.
now  Shelly focuses her fire to a smaller area with an increased range. Can be used 3 times per activation.\nAttacks slow enemies, slow duration increases with each hit.
  card.accessory.skill.maxAmmo  3  -> 3

