--- ShotgunGirl_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_MEDIKIT_DESC
raw  When Shelly falls below <VALUE1>% health, she instantly heals for <VALUE2> health. Band-Aid recharges in <VALUE3> sec.
now  When Shelly falls below 40% health, she instantly heals for 30 health. Band-Aid recharges in 15000 sec.
  VALUE1  40  -> 40
  VALUE2  30  -> 2340
  VALUE3  15000  -> 15

--- ShotgunGirl_unique_2 | star power | TID_SHOTGUNGIRL_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  When Shelly falls below <!card.value1>% health, she instantly heals for <!card.character.maxHealth.scaleCardValue2.scaleToLevel> and gains <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.speedBoostPercent>% movement speed for <!buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec. Band-Aid recharges in <!card.value3.msAsSeconds> sec.
now  When Shelly falls below 40% health, she instantly heals for 2340 and gains 15% movement speed for 3 sec. Band-Aid recharges in 15 sec.
  card.value1  40  -> 40
  card.character.maxHealth.scaleCardValue2.scaleToLevel  2340  -> 2340
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.speedBoostPercent  15  -> 15
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  3  -> 3
